  9, 'Compound Eyes', 'Compound Eyes raises the ability-bearer s accuracy by 30%. In Generations 3-5, this ability s name was formatted as Compoundeyes. If a Pokémon with Compound Eyes is first in the party, Pokémon that can be holding items have that chance increase from 50% to 60% (for common items), 5% to 20% (for uncommon items) or 1% to 5% (for rare items).'
  86, 'Cursed Body', ''
