  16, 'Flame Body', 'If a Pokémon with Flame Body is hit by a move that makes contact, there is a 30% chance the attacker will become burned. If a Pokémon with Flame Body (or Magma Armor or Steam Engine) and a Pokémon Egg are both in the party Pokémon, the number of steps required to hatch the egg are halved.'
